heb_rivok and heb_rivok_lite, Hebrew models for Tesseract OCR
Copyright 2026 Rivok Labs

heb_rivok is a fine-tuned derivative of the tessdata_best "script/Hebrew" model, and
heb_rivok_lite of the tessdata_best "heb" model (https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_best),
Copyright Google, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Their training text includes the Hebrew and English training text and word lists of
tesseract-ocr/langdata_lstm (https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/langdata_lstm), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Training images were rendered with fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Google Fonts
Hebrew families, Liberation), the GNU FreeFont licence and the DejaVu fonts licence. No font is
distributed with these models.

The example pages in examples/ use public-domain scans from Wikimedia Commons (National Library
of Israel) with reference text from Hebrew Wikisource (CC BY-SA 4.0). Examples are generated
locally by the scripts and not distributed in this repository.
